msgstr "bash（Linux/macOS）或 Git Bash（Windows）"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone and prepare"
msgstr "複製儲存庫並準備環境"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens.git\n"
"cd bomlens\n"
"\n"
"# Build the Docker image (when changing it locally)\n"
"cd docker && docker build -t sbom-scanner:local .\n"
"\n"
"# Smoke test\n"
"cd examples/nodejs\n"
"../../scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"NodeExample\" --version \"1.0.0\" --generate-only\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens.git\n"
"cd bomlens\n"
"\n"
"# Build the Docker image (when changing it locally)\n"
"cd docker && docker build -t sbom-scanner:local .\n"
"\n"
"# Smoke test\n"
"cd examples/nodejs\n"
"../../scripts/scan-sbom.sh --project \"NodeExample\" --version \"1.0.0\" --generate-only\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Pull request process"
msgstr "Pull Request 流程"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:60
msgid ""
"Before a new feature or bug fix, open a related issue first, or note your "
"intent on an existing one."
msgstr ""
"開始新功能或修正問題之前，請先開一個相關的 issue，或在既有的 issue 上說明你的"
"意願。"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:62
msgid "Fork the repository and create a purpose-named branch."
msgstr "Fork 儲存庫，並建立一個以用途命名的分支。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"   git checkout -b feat/add-kotlin-support\n"
"   git checkout -b fix/java-gradle-detection\n"
msgstr ""
"   git checkout -b feat/add-kotlin-support\n"
"   git checkout -b fix/java-gradle-detection\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:68
msgid "Make your changes and confirm all tests pass."
msgstr "完成修改，並確認所有測試都通過。"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "   ./tests/test-scan.sh\n"
msgstr "   ./tests/test-scan.sh\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:73
msgid ""
"Submit a PR that clearly describes the change. Confirm the checklist below."
msgstr "提出清楚說明變更內容的 PR，並確認下方的檢查清單。"

#. type: Bullet: '5. '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:75
msgid "Respond to reviewer feedback and make the needed adjustments."
msgstr "回應審閱者的意見，並做出必要的調整。"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "PR checklist"
msgstr "PR 檢查清單"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:82
msgid "[ ] I added tests for the change."
msgstr "[ ] 我為這次變更加上了測試。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:82
msgid "[ ] `./tests/test-scan.sh` passes."
msgstr "[ ] `./tests/test-scan.sh` 通過。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:82
msgid "[ ] I updated the relevant documentation."
msgstr "[ ] 我更新了相關文件。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:82
msgid ""
"[ ] My commit messages follow the [convention](#commit-message-convention)."
msgstr "[ ] 我的 commit 訊息遵循[規範](#commit-訊息規範)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "Coding style"
msgstr "程式碼風格"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:85
#, no-wrap
msgid "Shell scripts"
msgstr "Shell 指令碼"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:92
msgid "First line: `#!/usr/bin/env bash`"
msgstr "第一行：`#!/usr/bin/env bash`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:92
msgid ""
"Global variables: `UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`, local variables: `lower_snake_case`"
msgstr "全域變數：`UPPER_SNAKE_CASE`，區域變數：`lower_snake_case`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:92
msgid "Function names: `lower_snake_case`"
msgstr "函式名稱：`lower_snake_case`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:92
msgid "Error handling: `set -euo pipefail` at the top of the script"
msgstr "錯誤處理：在指令碼開頭加上 `set -euo pipefail`"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:92
msgid "Prefer long options over short ones (`--verbose` over `-v`)"
msgstr "偏好長選項而不是短選項（用 `--verbose` 而不用 `-v`）"

#. type: Fenced code block (bash)
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:93
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"readonly PROJECT_NAME=\"${1:-}\"\n"
"\n"
"function validate_input() {\n"
"    local project_name=\"$1\"\n"
"    if [[ -z \"$project_name\" ]]; then\n"
"        echo \"ERROR: Project name is required\" >&2\n"
"        return 1\n"
"    fi\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n"
"set -euo pipefail\n"
"\n"
"readonly PROJECT_NAME=\"${1:-}\"\n"
"\n"
"function validate_input() {\n"
"    local project_name=\"$1\"\n"
"    if [[ -z \"$project_name\" ]]; then\n"
"        echo \"ERROR: Project name is required\" >&2\n"
"        return 1\n"
"    fi\n"
"}\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dockerfile"
msgstr "Dockerfile"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:113
msgid "Use official base images"
msgstr "使用官方的基礎映像檔"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:113
msgid "Combine `RUN` commands to minimize layers"
msgstr "合併 `RUN` 指令以減少層數"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:113
msgid "Add a clear comment to each install step"
msgstr "為每個安裝步驟加上清楚的註解"

#. type: Title ##
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:114
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commit message convention"
msgstr "Commit 訊息規範"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:117
msgid ""
"Follow the [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) "
"format."
msgstr ""
"請遵循 [Conventional Commits](https://www.conventionalcommits.org/) 格式。"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:118
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n"
"\n"
"[body]\n"
"\n"
"[footer]\n"
msgstr ""
"<type>(<scope>): <subject>\n"
"\n"
"[body]\n"
"\n"
"[footer]\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:126
#, no-wrap
msgid "Types"
msgstr "Type 一覽"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:136
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Type | Description |\n"
"|------|-------------|\n"
"| `feat` | A new feature |\n"
"| `fix` | A bug fix |\n"
"| `docs` | Documentation changes |\n"
"| `test` | Adding or fixing tests |\n"
"| `refactor` | Refactoring (no feature/bug change) |\n"
"| `chore` | Build, dependencies, and other changes |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Type | 說明 |\n"
"|------|-------------|\n"
"| `feat` | 新功能 |\n"
"| `fix` | 修正問題 |\n"
"| `docs` | 文件變更 |\n"
"| `test` | 新增或修正測試 |\n"
"| `refactor` | 重構（不改變功能，也不修正問題） |\n"
"| `chore` | 建置、相依性與其他變更 |\n"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:137
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example"
msgstr "範例"

#. type: Fenced code block
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:139
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"feat(scanner): add Kotlin/Gradle support\n"
"\n"
"Add support for Kotlin projects using Gradle build system.\n"
"Uses cdxgen with KOTLIN_HOME environment variable.\n"
"\n"
