msgstr ""
"feat(scanner): add Kotlin/Gradle support\n"
"\n"
"Add support for Kotlin projects using Gradle build system.\n"
"Uses cdxgen with KOTLIN_HOME environment variable.\n"
"\n"
"Closes #42\n"

#. type: Title ##
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:148
#, no-wrap
msgid "Issues and discussions"
msgstr "Issue 與討論"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bug reports"
msgstr "問題回報"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:153
msgid ""
"Please use [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/issues). "
"Including the following helps us resolve it faster."
msgstr ""
"請使用 [GitHub Issues](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/issues)。附上以下"
"資訊有助於我們更快解決。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:157
msgid "Environment: OS, Docker version, script version"
msgstr "環境：OS、Docker 版本、指令碼版本"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:157
msgid "Reproduction: the minimal steps that reproduce the bug"
msgstr "重現方式：能重現問題的最少步驟"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:157
msgid "Expected vs actual result (include error messages)"
msgstr "預期結果與實際結果（請附上錯誤訊息）"

#. type: Title ###
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:158
#, no-wrap
msgid "Feature proposals"
msgstr "功能提案"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:161
msgid ""
"Discuss first in [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/"
"discussions), then move to an issue."
msgstr ""
"請先在 [GitHub Discussions](https://github.com/sktelecom/bomlens/"
"discussions) 討論，然後再轉為 issue。"

#. type: Plain text
#: CONTRIBUTING.md:164
msgid "Contact: [opensource@sktelecom.com](mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com)"
msgstr "聯絡方式：[opensource@sktelecom.com](mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com)"

#. type: Title #
#: SECURITY.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Security Policy"
msgstr "安全政策（Security Policy）"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **한국어**: [SECURITY.ko.md](SECURITY.ko.md)\n"
msgstr "> **English**: [SECURITY.md](SECURITY.md)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:6
msgid ""
"BomLens is a software supply-chain security tool, so the security of the "
"tool itself matters too. If you find a vulnerability, please report it "
"responsibly."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 是處理軟體供應鏈安全的工具，因此工具本身的安全同樣重要。若你發現弱"
"點，請依負責的程序通報。"

#. type: Title ##
#: SECURITY.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported versions"
msgstr "支援的版本（Supported versions）"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:10
msgid ""
"Security fixes are provided for the latest release. The `ghcr.io/sktelecom/"
"bomlens:latest` Docker image tag (legacy alias: `sbom-scanner:latest`) "
"reflects the latest security patches."
msgstr ""
"安全修正以最新的發佈版本為準提供。Docker 映像檔的 `ghcr.io/sktelecom/"
"bomlens:latest` 標籤（舊名別稱：`sbom-scanner:latest`）反映最新的安全修補。"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Version | Supported |\n"
"|---------|-----------|\n"
"| Latest release (`:latest`) | ✅ |\n"
"| Older versions | ❌ |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 版本 | 是否支援 |\n"
"|---------|-----------|\n"
"| 最新發佈版本（`:latest`） | ✅ |\n"
"| 更舊的版本 | ❌ |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:17
msgid ""
"If you are on an older version, please upgrade to the latest release first "
"and check whether the issue still reproduces."
msgstr ""
"若你使用的是較舊的版本，請先升級到最新的發佈版本，再確認問題是否仍會重現。"

#. type: Title ##
#: SECURITY.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reporting a vulnerability"
msgstr "通報弱點（Reporting a vulnerability）"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:21
msgid ""
"Please do **not** open a public issue. Report privately through one of the "
"two channels below."
msgstr "請**不要**開公開的 issue。請透過下列兩個管道之一，以非公開方式通報。"

#. type: Title ###
#: SECURITY.md:22
#, no-wrap
msgid "1. GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting"
msgstr "1. GitHub Private Vulnerability Reporting"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:25
msgid ""
"In this repository's **Security** tab, click **Report a vulnerability** to "
"submit a private advisory draft. It is visible only to maintainers, and the "
"fix and disclosure schedule can be coordinated in the same place."
msgstr ""
"在本儲存庫的 **Security** 分頁點選 **Report a vulnerability**，即可提交非公開"
"的安全公告（advisory）草稿。內容只有維護者看得到，修正與公開揭露的時程也能在"
"同一處協調。"

#. type: Title ###
#: SECURITY.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "2. Email"
msgstr "2. 電子郵件"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:29
msgid ""
"You may also email [opensource@sktelecom.com]"
"(mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com)."
msgstr ""
"你也可以寄信到 [opensource@sktelecom.com](mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com)。"

#. type: Title ###
#: SECURITY.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "What to include"
msgstr "通報時建議附上的資訊"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:36
msgid "The type of vulnerability and its impact"
msgstr "弱點的類型與影響範圍"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:36
msgid "The affected file path or code location"
msgstr "有問題的檔案路徑或程式碼位置"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:36
msgid "Reproduction steps or a proof of concept (PoC)"
msgstr "重現步驟或概念驗證（PoC）"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:36
msgid "If possible, the affected version and environment (OS, Docker version)"
msgstr "可能的話，附上受影響的版本與環境（OS、Docker 版本）"

#. type: Title ##
#: SECURITY.md:37
#, no-wrap
msgid "Process"
msgstr "處理流程（Process）"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:40
msgid ""
"When we receive a report, we respond along the following lines. This is a "
"volunteer-based project, so the timelines below are targets and may vary."
msgstr ""
"收到通報後，我們會依下列方式回應。本專案以志願者為基礎，因此以下時限是目標"
"值，可能會因情況而異。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:45
msgid "Acknowledge receipt within 3 business days."
msgstr "在 3 個營業日內確認收到。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:45
msgid ""
"Review, determine whether it is a vulnerability and its severity, and inform "
"the reporter."
msgstr "檢視後判斷是否為弱點及其嚴重程度，並告知通報者。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:45
msgid ""
"If a fix is needed, prepare a patch and coordinate the disclosure timing "
"with the reporter."
msgstr "若需要修正，會準備修補程式，並與通報者協調公開揭露的時機。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: SECURITY.md:45
msgid ""
"Once the fix is released, publish the security advisory and, if desired, "
"credit the reporter."
msgstr "修正發佈後，會公開安全公告，並在通報者希望的情況下標示其為貢獻者。"

#. type: Plain text
#: SECURITY.md:46
msgid ""
"Private reports are not shared externally until the fix and coordination are "
"complete."
msgstr "非公開的通報內容在修正與協調完成之前，不會對外分享。"

#. type: Title #
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Code of Conduct"
msgstr "行為準則"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **한국어**: [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md)\n"
msgstr "> **English**: [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:6
msgid ""
"This project adopts the **Contributor Covenant, version 2.1** as its Code of "
"Conduct. By participating, you agree to uphold it."
msgstr ""
"本專案採用 **Contributor Covenant, version 2.1** 作為行為準則。參與本專案即表"
"示你同意遵守它。"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:8
msgid ""
"The full, authoritative text is published by the Contributor Covenant "
"project:"
msgstr "完整且具權威性的條文由 Contributor Covenant 專案發佈："

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:11
msgid ""
"English: <https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/>"
msgstr ""
"英文：<https://www.contributor-covenant.org/version/2/1/code_of_conduct/>"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:11
msgid "Other languages: <https://www.contributor-covenant.org/translations/>"
msgstr "其他語言：<https://www.contributor-covenant.org/translations/>"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:13
msgid ""
"A Korean rendition is also kept in this repository at [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md]"
"(CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md)."
msgstr ""
"本儲存庫另存有一份韓文譯本，位於 [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md]"
"(CODE_OF_CONDUCT.ko.md)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:14
#, no-wrap
msgid "Scope"
msgstr "適用範圍"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:17
msgid ""
"The Code of Conduct applies within all project spaces — the repository, "
"issues, pull requests, and discussions — and when an individual is "
"representing the project in public spaces."
msgstr ""
"行為準則適用於專案的所有空間——儲存庫、Issue、Pull Request 與 Discussions——也"
"適用於個人在公開場合代表本專案的時候。"

#. type: Title ##
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:18
#, no-wrap
msgid "Reporting"
msgstr "通報方式"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:21
msgid ""
"To report unacceptable behavior, contact the maintainers at "
"[opensource@sktelecom.com](mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com). All reports are "
"reviewed and investigated promptly and fairly, and the reporter's privacy "
"and security are respected."
msgstr ""
"若要通報無法接受的行為，請透過 [opensource@sktelecom.com]"
"(mailto:opensource@sktelecom.com) 聯絡維護者。所有通報都會迅速且公正地檢視與"
"調查，通報者的隱私與安全也會受到尊重。"

#. type: Plain text
#: CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md:22
msgid ""
"Enforcement follows the Contributor Covenant 2.1 enforcement guidelines "
"(Correction, Warning, Temporary Ban, Permanent Ban), as described in the "
"full text linked above."
msgstr ""
"執行方式依照 Contributor Covenant 2.1 的執行準則（更正 Correction、警告 "
"Warning、暫時停權 Temporary Ban、永久停權 Permanent Ban），詳見上方連結的完整"
"條文。"

#. type: Title #
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:1
#, no-wrap
msgid "Third-Party Licenses"
msgstr "第三方授權條款"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:4
#, no-wrap
msgid "> **한국어**: [THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.ko.md](THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.ko.md)\n"
msgstr "> **English**: [THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md](THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:6
msgid ""
"BomLens (Apache-2.0) keeps its own code in shell scripts and bundles several "
"open-source tools into its Docker images to generate and analyze SBOMs. This "
"document is the license inventory for the bundled tools and the distribution "
"obligations that come with them."
msgstr ""
"BomLens（Apache-2.0）自身的程式碼寫成 shell 指令碼，並把數個開放原始碼工具打"
"包進 Docker 映像檔，用來產生與分析 SBOM。本文件是這些內附工具的授權清單，以及"
"隨之而來的散布義務。"

#. type: Title ##
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:7
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compliance summary"
msgstr "合規要點"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"The BomLens shell scripts invoke the bundled tools as separate processes "
"(exec) and do not modify their sources. The copyleft of GPL and AGPL tools "
"therefore does not propagate to the Apache-2.0 code of BomLens (per the FSF "
"reading: pipes, CLI calls, and exec make separate programs; bundling in a "
"container is mere aggregation)."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 的 shell 指令碼是以獨立行程（exec）呼叫內附工具，並未修改工具的原始"
"碼。因此 GPL 與 AGPL 工具的 copyleft 不會傳播到 BomLens 的 Apache-2.0 程式碼"
"（依 FSF 的見解：管線、CLI 呼叫與 exec 構成各自獨立的程式，打包進容器屬於 "
"mere aggregation）。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"The tool binaries are still redistributed inside the images, so the license "
"texts and, for GPL tools, a path to the corresponding source are provided. "
"The SPDX license texts (Apache-2.0, MIT, GPL-2.0, GPL-3.0, and others) ship "
"inside the images at `/usr/local/lib/sbom/licenses/`, and each tool's source "
"is available from the Source URL in the tables below."
msgstr ""
"工具的二進位檔仍然隨映像檔一起再次散布，因此我們提供授權條款全文，GPL 工具還"
"額外提供對應原始碼的取得途徑。SPDX 授權條款全文（Apache-2.0、MIT、GPL-2.0、"
"GPL-3.0 等）隨映像檔放在 `/usr/local/lib/sbom/licenses/`，各工具的原始碼可從"
"下方表格的 Source URL 取得。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"BomLens ships its own terms with every distribution. In the images they are "
"at `/usr/local/lib/sbom/notices/`, holding `LICENSE`, `NOTICE`, and this "
"document; in the release bundles they sit at the top of the extracted tree; "
"in the desktop installer they are in the app's resources folder. Passing "
"those files along when you redistribute an image or a bundle is what "
"Apache-2.0 §4 asks for."
msgstr ""
"BomLens 自身的使用條款會隨每一份散布物一起提供。在映像檔中位於 `/usr/local/"
"lib/sbom/notices/`，內含 `LICENSE`、`NOTICE` 與本文件；在發行壓縮包中位於解開"
"後的最上層；在桌面版安裝檔中則位於應用程式的資源資料夾。您再次散布映像檔或壓"
"縮包時一併轉交這些檔案，就是 Apache-2.0 §4 所要求的做法。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"No AGPL-licensed tool is included. Running the web UI (`--ui`) therefore "
"does not trigger the AGPL §13 network clause."
msgstr ""
"未收錄任何以 AGPL 授權的工具。因此即使執行網頁介面（`--ui`），也不會觸發 "
"AGPL §13 的網路條款。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"The GPL-licensed analysis tools live only in a separate opt-in image "
"(`bomlens-firmware`). The tools installed into the base image (`bomlens`) "
"and into the other opt-in images (`bomlens-aibom`, `bomlens-deep-cve`) are "
"permissive."
msgstr ""
"以 GPL 授權的分析工具只存在於另一個獨立的選用映像檔（`bomlens-firmware`）。安"
"裝進基礎映像檔（`bomlens`）以及其他選用映像檔（`bomlens-aibom`、`bomlens-"
"deep-cve`）的工具都是 permissive 授權。"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:15
msgid ""
"Every image, the base one included, is built on `python:3.12-slim` and "
"therefore also contains Debian system packages under the GPL, the LGPL and "
"other licenses. That is inherent to any Linux base image; there is no GPL-"
"free one. See [Debian packages in every image](#debian-packages-in-every-"
"image) below for what this means and where the source is."
msgstr ""
"每一個映像檔（包含基礎映像檔）都建置在 `python:3.12-slim` 之上，因此也含有以 "
"GPL、LGPL 與其他授權條款釋出的 Debian 系統套件。這是任何 Linux 基礎映像檔的固"
"有性質，沒有不含 GPL 的選擇。這代表什麼、原始碼從哪裡取得，請看下方的[所有映"
"像檔的 Debian 套件](#debian-packages-in-every-image)。"

#. type: Title ##
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Base image — `ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens` (BomLens tools; see also the Debian base below)"
msgstr "基礎映像檔——`ghcr.io/sktelecom/bomlens`（BomLens 安裝的工具；Debian 基底另見下方）"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Tool | Purpose | License (SPDX) | Source |\n"
"|------|---------|----------------|--------|\n"
"| cdxgen (official language images) | SBOM generation from source | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen |\n"
"| syft | SBOM for images, binaries, and directories | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/anchore/syft |\n"
"| Trivy | Vulnerability scanning | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy |\n"
"| trivy-db | Vulnerability database | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db |\n"
"| cosign | SBOM signing | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/sigstore/cosign |\n"
"| scancode-toolkit | Detailed license detection. Build-time opt-in (`SBOM_DEEP_LICENSE=true`); **not present in the published images**, which are built with the default `false` | Apache-2.0 (parts of the dataset CC-BY-4.0 and others) | https://github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit |\n"
"| scanoss (scanoss.py) | Vendored open-source identification (bundled by default; disable with `SBOM_SCANOSS=false`) | MIT (the bundled `osadl-copyleft.json` dataset is CC-BY-4.0) | https://github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py |\n"
"| owasp-aibom-generator | AI model SBOM generation (opt-in `SBOM_AIBOM`, separate image `bomlens-aibom`; calls the HuggingFace API) | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator |\n"
"| picklescan | Pickle analysis for scanned AI model files — whether loading the weights would run code (always installed; pure Python, no network) | MIT | https://github.com/mmaitre314/picklescan |\n"
"| jq | SBOM post-processing helper | MIT (some components BSD, ICU, or Lucent) | https://github.com/jqlang/jq |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 工具 | 用途 | 授權條款 (SPDX) | Source |\n"
"|------|---------|----------------|--------|\n"
"| cdxgen（官方語言映像檔） | 從原始碼產生 SBOM | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/CycloneDX/cdxgen |\n"
"| syft | 映像檔、二進位檔與目錄的 SBOM | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/anchore/syft |\n"
"| Trivy | 安全弱點掃描 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy |\n"
"| trivy-db | 弱點資料庫 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/aquasecurity/trivy-db |\n"
"| cosign | SBOM 簽章 | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/sigstore/cosign |\n"
"| scancode-toolkit | 精細的授權條款檢出。建置時選用（`SBOM_DEEP_LICENSE=true`）；**發行的映像檔並未收錄**，發行版是以預設值 `false` 建置 | Apache-2.0（資料集部分為 CC-BY-4.0 等） | https://github.com/aboutcode-org/scancode-toolkit |\n"
"| scanoss (scanoss.py) | 已複製納入的開放原始碼識別（預設內附；要停用請設 `SBOM_SCANOSS=false`） | MIT（內附的 `osadl-copyleft.json` 資料集為 CC-BY-4.0） | https://github.com/scanoss/scanoss.py |\n"
"| owasp-aibom-generator | 產生 AI 模型 SBOM（選用 `SBOM_AIBOM`，獨立映像檔 `bomlens-aibom`；會呼叫 HuggingFace API） | Apache-2.0 | https://github.com/GenAI-Security-Project/aibom-generator |\n"
"| picklescan | 對掃描到的 AI 模型檔案做 pickle 分析——判斷載入權重時是否會執行程式碼（一律安裝；純 Python，不連網） | MIT | https://github.com/mmaitre314/picklescan |\n"
"| jq | SBOM 後處理輔助工具 | MIT（部分元件為 BSD、ICU 或 Lucent） | https://github.com/jqlang/jq |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:32
msgid ""
"Data: NVD, the vulnerability source, is public domain and requires "
"attribution to \"NIST/NVD\"."
msgstr ""
"資料：弱點資料來源 NVD 屬於 public domain，並要求標示「NIST/NVD」出處。"

#. type: Title ###
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bundled data snapshots"
msgstr "內附的資料快照"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:36
msgid ""
"Two datasets are fetched once at image-build time and shipped inside the "
"base image so the offline checks that read them need no network access at "
"scan time. The build scripts that fetch them are deleted from the image "
"afterwards, so the attribution is recorded here instead."
msgstr ""
"有兩份資料集在映像檔建置時抓取一次，並隨基礎映像檔一起收錄，讓讀取它們的離線"
"檢查在掃描時不需要網路。抓取資料的建置指令碼在建置完成後就從映像檔中刪除，因"
"此把出處記錄在這裡。"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:41
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Data | Bundled at | Source | License |\n"
"|------|-----------|--------|---------|\n"
"| End-of-life dates | `/usr/local/lib/sbom/eol-data.json`, `eol-purl-map.json` | [endoflife.date](https://endoflife.date), read from its public API | MIT |\n"
"| Malicious package advisories | `/usr/local/lib/sbom/malicious-index.json` | OSV bulk archives (`osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com`). The `MAL-` records they carry are published by the OpenSSF Package Analysis project, [ossf/malicious-packages](https://github.com/ossf/malicious-packages) | Apache-2.0 (upstream advisory repository) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 資料 | 映像檔內路徑 | 出處 | 授權條款 |\n"
"|------|-----------|--------|---------|\n"
"| 已終止支援日期 | `/usr/local/lib/sbom/eol-data.json`, `eol-purl-map.json` | [endoflife.date](https://endoflife.date)，從它的公開 API 讀取 | MIT |\n"
"| 惡意套件安全公告 | `/usr/local/lib/sbom/malicious-index.json` | OSV 批次封存檔（`osv-vulnerabilities.storage.googleapis.com`）。其中所帶的 `MAL-` 紀錄由 OpenSSF Package Analysis 專案發佈於 [ossf/malicious-packages](https://github.com/ossf/malicious-packages) | Apache-2.0（上游公告儲存庫） |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:43
msgid ""
"Neither dataset is reproduced whole. Each is reduced to what the check "
"actually reads — a product's end-of-life dates, or a PURL keyed to its "
"advisory id — and the snapshot date travels with it, both in the bundled "
"file and on every component the check flags (`bomlens:eol:source`, "
"`bomlens:malicious:source`). Neither project endorses or certifies BomLens, "
"and the bundled data is provided as is."
msgstr ""
"兩份資料集都不是原樣完整複製，而是各自縮減到檢查實際會讀取的部分——某個產品的"
"已終止支援日期，或是一個 PURL 對應到它的公告識別碼——快照日期也隨之記錄，既寫"
"在內附檔案裡，也標在檢查所標記的每一個元件上（`bomlens:eol:source`、"
"`bomlens:malicious:source`）。這兩個專案都不為 BomLens 背書或認證，內附資料以"
"現狀提供。"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:45
msgid ""
"The CPE applicability index in the firmware image comes from NVD rather than "
"either of these, and its attribution and notices ship beside it inside that "
"image as `CVE-DATA-NOTICE.txt`."
msgstr ""
"韌體映像檔中的 CPE 適用性索引不是來自上述兩者，而是來自 NVD，其出處標示與聲明"
"以 `CVE-DATA-NOTICE.txt` 隨該映像檔一起提供。"

#. type: Title ###
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web UI npm packages"
msgstr "網頁介面的 npm 套件"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:49
msgid ""
"The web UI (`--ui`) is a React single-page application. npm package code is "
"compiled into the build output, and that output is redistributed inside the "
"base image and the desktop installer, so the copyright and permission "
"notices MIT and ISC ask for have to travel with it."
msgstr ""
"網頁介面（`--ui`）是一個 React 單頁應用程式。npm 套件的程式碼會編譯進建置產"
"出，而該產出會隨基礎映像檔與桌面版安裝檔一起再次散布，因此 MIT 與 ISC 所要求"
"的著作權與許可聲明必須隨之提供。"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:51
msgid ""
"The authoritative record is `third-party-licenses.txt`, generated at build "
"time. It lists only the packages that actually reach the bundle and "
"reproduces each one's license text in full. Open it at `/third-party-"
"licenses.txt` in the web UI; inside the image it is at `/usr/local/lib/sbom-"
"web/dist/third-party-licenses.txt`. It comes from the bundled module graph "
"rather than the `package.json` declaration because the two differ: declared "
"dependencies used only at build time (tailwindcss, typescript) never reach "
"the distribution, and a package can be declared and installed yet dropped "
"from the bundle because nothing imports it."
msgstr ""
"正式記錄是建置時產生的 `third-party-licenses.txt`。它只列出實際進入打包結果的"
"套件，並完整重現每一個套件的授權條款全文。在網頁介面中可從 `/third-party-"
"licenses.txt` 開啟；在映像檔內則位於 `/usr/local/lib/sbom-web/dist/third-"
"party-licenses.txt`。它取自打包後的模組關係圖，而不是 `package.json` 的宣告，"
"因為兩者並不一致：只在建置時使用的宣告相依項目（tailwindcss、typescript）不會"
"進入散布物，而一個套件也可能被宣告並安裝了，卻因為沒有任何地方匯入它而從打包"
"結果中被剔除。"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:53
msgid ""
"The 23 packages currently in the bundle are below. All are permissive; none "
"is copyleft."
msgstr ""
"目前進入打包結果的 23 個套件如下。全部都是 permissive 授權，沒有任何 "
"copyleft。"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Package | Purpose | License (SPDX) |\n"
"|---------|---------|----------------|\n"
"| react, react-dom, scheduler | UI rendering | MIT |\n"
"| @radix-ui/react-label, react-progress, react-slot, react-primitive, react-context, react-compose-refs | Accessible primitives | MIT |\n"
"| cytoscape, cytoscape-dagre, dagre, graphlib, lodash | Dependency graph rendering and layout | MIT |\n"
"| i18next, react-i18next, i18next-browser-languagedetector | English, Korean and Traditional Chinese switching | MIT |\n"
"| class-variance-authority | Component variant definitions | Apache-2.0 |\n"
"| clsx, tailwind-merge | Class name composition | MIT |\n"
"| lucide-react | Icons | ISC |\n"
"| highlight.js | Syntax highlighting in the source viewer (grammars loaded on demand) | BSD-3-Clause |\n"
"| @fontsource/inter, @fontsource/jetbrains-mono, @fontsource/noto-sans-tc, pretendard | Fonts (see the section below) | OFL-1.1 |\n"
msgstr ""
"| 套件 | 用途 | 授權條款 (SPDX) |\n"
"|---------|---------|----------------|\n"
"| react, react-dom, scheduler | 使用者介面渲染 | MIT |\n"
"| @radix-ui/react-label, react-progress, react-slot, react-primitive, react-context, react-compose-refs | 具無障礙支援的基本元件 | MIT |\n"
"| cytoscape, cytoscape-dagre, dagre, graphlib, lodash | 相依關係圖的繪製與版面配置 | MIT |\n"
"| i18next, react-i18next, i18next-browser-languagedetector | 英文、韓文與正體中文切換 | MIT |\n"
"| class-variance-authority | 元件變體定義 | Apache-2.0 |\n"
"| clsx, tailwind-merge | 類別名稱組合 | MIT |\n"
"| lucide-react | 圖示 | ISC |\n"
"| highlight.js | 原始碼檢視器的語法高亮（文法按需載入） | BSD-3-Clause |\n"
"| @fontsource/inter, @fontsource/jetbrains-mono, @fontsource/noto-sans-tc, pretendard | 字型（見下一節） | OFL-1.1 |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:67
msgid ""
"`npm run notices:check` keeps the list from going stale by checking the "
"generated file. CI fails when a bundled package declares no license, when no "
"license text was found to reproduce, or when any copyleft license appears."
msgstr ""
"`npm run notices:check` 會檢查產生出來的檔案，避免這份清單過時。只要有內附套"
"件未宣告授權條款、找不到可重現的授權條款全文，或出現任何 copyleft 授權，CI 就"
"會失敗。"

#. type: Title ###
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "Web UI components (adapted from shadcn/ui)"
msgstr "網頁介面元件（改寫自 shadcn/ui）"

#. type: Plain text
#: THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md:71
msgid ""
"shadcn/ui is not a library you install; its component code is copied into "
"the project. So it never appears in the npm dependency list even though the "
"code is in this repository. The following seven files under `docker/web/"
"frontend/src/components/ui/` are shadcn/ui components adapted to our design "
"tokens and accessibility requirements."
msgstr ""
"shadcn/ui 不是安裝來用的程式庫，它的元件程式碼是複製到專案裡的。因此即使程式"
"碼就在本儲存庫中，它也不會出現在 npm 相依項目清單裡。`docker/web/frontend/"
"src/components/ui/` 底下的下列七個檔案，是把 shadcn/ui 的元件改寫成符合我們的"
"設計 token 與無障礙需求的版本。"

