"| `badge.tsx`, `button.tsx`, `card.tsx`, `input.tsx`, `label.tsx`, `progress.tsx`, `tabs.tsx` | shadcn/ui (MIT, Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn), https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui |\n"
msgstr ""
